# --- Direct PromptPay QR (no payment gateway) ---
# The shop's PromptPay receiving account. Accepts:
#   - a Thai mobile number  e.g. 0812345678
#   - a 13-digit National ID / Tax ID  e.g. 1234567890123
# Leave blank to disable the dynamic QR (cashier can still confirm manually).
VITE_PROMPTPAY_ID=0955555555

# Name shown above the QR code on the checkout screen.
VITE_MERCHANT_NAME=ร้าน ยำแซ่บ
